lesions of the adult respiratory distress syndrome</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>1983</year><volume>112</volume><fpage>112</fpage><lpage>126</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6859225</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bone</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Francis</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><name><surname>Pierce</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intravascular coagulation associated with the adult respiratory distress syndrome</article-title><source>Am J Med</source><year>1976</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>585</fpage><lpage>589</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">984062</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0002-9343(76)90135-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Ratliff</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Parrott</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Lamy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Fallat</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Koeniger</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Yaeger</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitmer</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pulmonary pathology in acute respiratory insufficiency: lung biopsy as a diagnostic tool</article-title><source>J Thorac Cardiovasc Surg</source><year>1976</year><volume>71</volume><fpage>64</fpage><lpage>71</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">765628</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saldeen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The microembolism syndrom